{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o021","title":"曹操下令责崔琰通宾客、虬须直视，遂赐琰死","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-4f066fb001745be721d1","label":"正文","text":"曹操下令责崔琰通宾客、虬须直视，遂赐琰死","evidence":["cuimao-q-7e1e211c01ad147dab68"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-d2b1e99d361aefcf5668","label":"裴注·《魏略》","text":"前白者复白崔琰为徒虬须直视心似不平，太祖以为然遂欲杀之","evidence":["cuimao-q-35c479ba4892d7247aae"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-2f65e5cc31e3c2ab21d1","label":"裴注·《魏略》","text":"太祖使清公大吏往经营崔琰，敕三日期消息，琰不悟","evidence":["cuimao-q-602f135568fafb053ada"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-42094f31108b589e9f09","label":"裴注·《魏略》","text":"吏故白琰平安，公忿然言崔琰必欲使孤行刀锯，吏以教告琰","evidence":["cuimao-q-74a9bacc4c08ecd777d4"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-812a597351b9e1ca2422","label":"裴注·《魏略》","text":"崔琰谢吏自言我殊不宜，遂自杀","evidence":["cuimao-q-aeeddafe2b8d0b93d838"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"下令赐死者；以为然而欲杀者；使吏经营者；忿然欲行刀锯者","evidence":["cuimao-q-7e1e211c01ad147dab68","cuimao-q-35c479ba4892d7247aae","cuimao-q-602f135568fafb053ada","cuimao-q-74a9bacc4c08ecd777d4"]},{"person":"wudi-p0320","role":"被赐死者；被复白者；不悟者；闻教者；自杀者","evidence":["cuimao-q-7e1e211c01ad147dab68","cuimao-q-35c479ba4892d7247aae","cuimao-q-602f135568fafb053ada","cuimao-q-74a9bacc4c08ecd777d4","cuimao-q-aeeddafe2b8d0b93d838"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-7e1e211c01ad147dab68","cuimao-q-35c479ba4892d7247aae","cuimao-q-602f135568fafb053ada","cuimao-q-74a9bacc4c08ecd777d4","cuimao-q-aeeddafe2b8d0b93d838"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-7e1e211c01ad147dab68","source_order":[12,69,0],"order":2718}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0320","name":"崔琰","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-35c479ba4892d7247aae","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-672c272ed7349d376380","layer":"pei","quote":"前所白琰者，又复白之云：‘琰为徒，虬须直视，心似不平。’时太祖亦以为然，遂欲杀之","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传